      {
        "id": 263937,
        "name": "FrivYeti",
        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:20:57.464Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"LonelyMan\" data-post=\"21\" data-topic=\"18128\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> LonelyMan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think doing that is within the possibility of modern AI, though it would take a lot of trial and error to get it right.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Integrating genAI into their video games would be a very quick way for Handelabra to tank their reputation and their fanbase. If someone really wanted to do that for some godforsaken reason, they could do it themselves.</p>",
