        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"LonelyMan\" data-post=\"23\" data-topic=\"18128\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> LonelyMan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But I think if an AI were trained on all the art Adam ever did, and also on how to read Handelabra logs, you could probably code together a generator that turns the log into a comic.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Christ, that’s a depressing thought.</p>",
