      {
        "id": 263940,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-03T23:25:07.385Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Why?!  I’m not proposing AI should replace Adam, I’m saying use AI to crank out hundreds of paintings an hour every day for years, something you could never possibly ask Adam to do no matter how much you paid him.  Adam would still get work, because he can draw something he’s never drawn before, and an AI probably can’t, and definitely can’t choose to draw in a different style at whim as Adam can.  AI is just a tool for mass production; I literally think the assembly line is a bigger threat to human autonomy.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2025-10-03T23:25:07.385Z",
