      {
        "id": 263942,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-04T00:13:02.005Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well I don’t think it would be meaningless slop, let alone disgusting shit.  I’m currently working on hand-editing a game log into a somewhat enjoyable story, and it’s an extreme amount of work; if I could get a machine to do it for me, to any acceptable degree of quality, I’d happily keep the numerous hours I’m spending on this effort.  If the output of AI efforts is “sludge”, then it’s the fault of the tool’s users for using it poorly, not the fault of the tool’s existence.  So I don’t want to invalidate your feelings, but you’re seeing a dark cloud, and I’m seeing a silver lining.  And I really don’t want anyone to take my silver lining away because of how much they oppose the dark cloud.</p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2025-10-04T00:13:02.005Z",
